   JavaScript assigns a single viewport family to html/body/#vnOverlay so the
   regular intro, standard Pixel dialogue, and prediction scenes all inherit
   the same responsive intent. This trims the breakpoint pile-up and keeps the
   device-zoo rules from arguing with one another.
